name: NewAPI 签到
description: 适配新旧版NewAPI源码搭建的中转站，支持多站点自动签到。新版站点自动抓取 /api/user/auth/refresh 请求中的登录会话（约30天）；旧版站点抓取 /api/user/self 的Cookie。凭据失效后重新登录站点并打开页面即可自动更新。
icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xushier/HD-Icons/main/border-radius/new-api-1.png
scriptings:
- http_request:
    name: NewAPI签到获取Headers
    match: ^https:\/\/.*\/api\/user\/(self|auth\/refresh)$
    script_url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/changzhongxinxin/ModuRule/refs/heads/main/JS/NewApi/NewApi获取CK.js
    timeout: 120
    body_required: false
- schedule:
    name: NewAPI签到定时执行
    cron: 10 0 * * *
    script_url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/changzhongxinxin/ModuRule/refs/heads/main/JS/NewApi/NewApi签到.js
    timeout: 120

